Open new project and click java ,give file name and click maven..Setup will be done

add a java code under org.example in the file called Main.java

Next Add this plugin tag in pom.xml after </properties>
<build>
<plugins>
  <plugin>
    <groupId>org.apache.maven.plugins</groupId>
    <artifactId>maven-jar-plugin</artifactId>
    <version>3.5.0</version>
    <configuration>
        <archive>
            <manifest>
                <mainClass>org.example.Main</mainClass>
            </manifest>
        </archive>
    </configuration>
 </plugin>
</plugins>
</build>

A target folder will be created.

Run these in  terminal:

mvn clean install

cd target\

java -jar maven123JAR-1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar    (reference: under target folder u will see smtg like projname-1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar , copy that n paste it there)

(o/p of java appplication will be seen)





